% (the last digit of floor(10|X|)), z = 1 if |X| - T is not zero, else 0.
% Hence round(X) = s(T + [d >= 5]); ceil(X) = T + z if s is +, else -T;
% floor(X) = T if s is +, else -(T + z). X: F, M, or raw A, A[N], A/B,
% A/B[N].
