% 64 bit intermediate product). The estimate is within 0.0015 of
% 10^4 R_(i-1)/B, so |R_i| <= 0.5015 B for i >= 1, |q_i| <= 5100 for
% i >= 2, 1000 <= q_1 < 10^5, and no correction step is needed. Then
