% needed to check elsewhere in the source code how the ; hack is done.
%
% The #2 in \XINT_allexpr_iter is \xint_c_i from the ; hack. Formerly (xint <
% 1.4) there was no such token. The change is motivated to using ; also in
% subsm() syntax.
